OL,3,GNEWSANurse made bad decisions after
OL,4,Afinding patient cold and unresponsive,
OL,5,Ainquest told
OL,6,
OL,7,FA nurse who failed to raise the alarm
OL,8,Fwhen he found a patient cold and
OL,9,Funresponsive made "bad decisions" and
OL,10,F"panicked", an inquest has heard.
OL,12,FMohammed Jaafri, of Dyserth near Rhyl,
OL,13,Fdied at Glan Clwyd hospital in April
OL,14,Flast year.
OL,16,FRuthin coroner's court heard Joseph
OL,17,FKamangire found Jaafri cold and
OL,18,Funresponsive and decided he had died.
OL,20,FBut he did not follow resuscitation
OL,21,Fguidelines and issue a "cardiac arrest"
OL,22,Fcall to doctors.
